Acts 14:1 , Paul and Barnabas are persecuted from Iconium;
Acts 14:8 , At Lystra Paul heals a cripple, whereupon they are reputed as gods;
Acts 14:19 , Paul is stoned;
Acts 14:21 , They pass through divers churches, confirming the disciples in faith and patience;
Acts 14:26 , Returning to Antioch, they report what God had done with them.
